    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 13th level, you are able to make the most of an opportune moment. When you take the Attack action on your turn and score a critical hit with a weapon attack, you may make another weapon attack as part of the same Attack action.</p><p>In addition, whenever a creature within 5 feet of you is hit by a critical attack made by a creature other than you, you can use your reaction to make a melee attack against that creature.</p>",
